<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts IBM estimate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts IBM estimate.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch analyst Daniel Mandresh cut his 1997 earnings estimate on International Business Machines Corp to $13 a share from $13.40, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Mandresh was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Traders said he reiterated a 1-1 rating on the stock, meaning a long-term and near-term buy, and reiterated his price target of $195.</p>
<p>-- Mandresh maintained his 1998 earnings estimate of $15 a share, they said.</p>
</text>
